  InspectionTexts:
  - Guess someone had extra time this year. Looks nice, though.
  - Feels kind of peaceful here. Even with all the fake graves.
  - Not bad. Looks like something from an old movie set.
  - Feels quiet around here. Not sure why.
  - "It\u2019s a nice setup. The ground\u2019s colder than I expected, though."
  - "They must\u2019ve used real dirt. It smells\u2026 old."
